# The safety check: changed text after the module's end is an internal
# error (exit 3), and nothing is written.
program Opp
arg --damage
arg 3
arg tests/data/fmt-comments.Mod
status 3
output
opp: internal error: tests/data/fmt-comments.Mod: the formatted text, at 37:13: the text after the module's end differs; nothing written
